CODEGEN.md §3.5, §7.3, DECISIONS 392: a baked emit's Build may be cut into parts <P>Access::Build<N>; a record Build0 is the type the part Build0 would hide inside the access struct (g++: "'Build0' does not name a type"), whatever the table's size.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// Named like a part of Build.
record Build0 {
  /// Its size.
  n: Int
}

/// The rows.
let rows: table Build0 = {
  x { n: 1 }
}

emit cpp { out: "@features/a", namespace: "a", mode: baked }
